{"tool_name":"rapidstorm","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>The rapidSTORM project is an open source evaluation tool that provides fast and highly configurable data processing for single-molecule localization microscopy such as dSTORM. It provides both two-dimensional and three-dimensional, multi-color data analysis as well as a wide range of filtering and image generation capabilities. The general operation of rapidSTORM is described in Wolter et al (2012).</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>The rapidSTORM project is an open source evaluation tool that provides fast and highly configurable data processing for single-molecule localization microscopy such as dSTORM. It provides both two-dimensional and three-dimensional, multi-color data analysis as well as a wide range of filtering and image generation capabilities. The general operation of rapidSTORM is described in Wolter et al (2012).</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-02T10:24:03+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2014-12-09T14:27:50+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505204784,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Steve Wolter"},{"value":"Sven Proppert"},{"value":"Sarah Aufmkolk"},{"value":"Andr\u00e9 Lampe"},{"value":"Teresa Klein"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"https://www.biozentrum.uni-wuerzburg.de/super-resolution/archiv/rapidstorm/","uri":"https://stevewolter.github.io/rapidSTORM/"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":202,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"0b32af66-b05e-4590-a85e-ce50aff9edd4","url":"/user/202"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4053,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/ope